# Title: PowerShell Script Run in AppData
# ID: ac175779-025a-4f12-98b0-acdaeb77ea85
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Jonhnathan Ribeiro, oscd.community
# Date: 2019-01-09
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects a suspicious command line execution that invokes PowerShell with reference to an AppData folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "powershell.exe" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\powershell" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "\\pwsh" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "pwsh.exe")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "/c " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "\\AppData\\") AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "Local\\" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "Roaming\\")))
